#### Foundation Models for Time-Series Forecasting


Welcome! This repository has been created as part of the work of the seminar Advanced Topics in Machine Learning from the Department of Information Systems at the University of Münster.

The goal of this research repository is to act as a documentation of the implemenation accompanying the paper Foundation Models for Time-Series Forecasting, the goal of which is to compare 4 transformer-based models for time-series forecasting.


The repo consists of the following branches:

*main: This branch, containing a readme with explanations.
training-and-testing-notebooks: The most important branch, containing the Jupyter Notebooks ran on Google Colab in order to train and test, as well as zero-shot or fine-tune models on 4 datasets. The data 
colabsamformer: The forked SAMFormer repository, one of the models used in the research report. The code has been modified so that the model could be correctly run.
timesfm (deprecated):